      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.77,
      "end_seconds": 19.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "I wanted to get difficulty putting on my socks looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.59,
      "end_seconds": 23.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.91,
      "end_seconds": 27.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "it's been two years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.74,
      "end_seconds": 31.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "how much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.83,
      "end_seconds": 34.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "mostly moderate"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.75,
      "end_seconds": 40.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.06,
      "end_seconds": 49.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.59,
      "end_seconds": 80.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 18, pulse is 80 beats a a minute and BP is 115 over 79, temp 36.5 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.59,
      "end_seconds": 84.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.61,
      "end_seconds": 88.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.05,
      "end_seconds": 93.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.96,
      "end_seconds": 96.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "okay, nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.69,
      "end_seconds": 119.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Rotation of the right hip is painful and limited compared with the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.16,
      "end_seconds": 133.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.49,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Let me check a few things. Any swelling of the leg, fall, weight loss or numbness in the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.86,
      "end_seconds": 136.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.06,
      "end_seconds": 142.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.09,
      "end_seconds": 145.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "no, all normal there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.36,
      "end_seconds": 164.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "alright is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.48,
      "end_seconds": 169.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Hmm, my mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.53,
      "end_seconds": 175.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.99,
      "end_seconds": 187.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure i've been reading about it online and it worried me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.12,
      "end_seconds": 193.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.08,
      "end_seconds": 204.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Alright, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.37,
      "end_seconds": 212.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.32,
      "end_seconds": 216.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.61,
      "end_seconds": 220.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.67,
      "end_seconds": 222.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.25,
      "end_seconds": 230.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.76,
      "end_seconds": 233.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.2,
      "end_seconds": 238.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.19,
      "end_seconds": 257.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.94,
      "end_seconds": 264.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Hydrochlorothiazide, 12.5 milligrams, every morning it's paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.88,
      "end_seconds": 309.23,
      "duration_seconds": 29.35,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is osteoarthritis of the right hip. We should do a hip X-ray for hip pain. Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the hip. Let's get you seen by physiotherapy, I'll arrange the letter. I'd like you to see the orthopaedic clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.81,
      "end_seconds": 319.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.92,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.74,
      "end_seconds": 328.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "thank you, you know, that's clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.11,
      "end_seconds": 337.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "See me again after the X-ray. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.27,
      "end_seconds": 342.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Oh, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.5,
      "end_seconds": 344.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
